{"kind": "heading", "local_path": "materialized_sources/corpus/methodology-ontology-design-patterns--b759ea2c/document.md", "ordinal": 7, "selector": "web://23541a33ead34e41#B7", "text_preview": "Ontology Design Patterns . org (ODP) (Redirected from Main Page )"}
{"kind": "paragraph", "local_path": "materialized_sources/corpus/methodology-ontology-design-patterns--b759ea2c/document.md", "ordinal": 8, "selector": "web://23541a33ead34e41#B8", "text_preview": "OntologyDesignPatterns.org is a Semantic Web portal dedicated to ontology design patterns (ODPs) , run by the ODPA ."}
{"kind": "paragraph", "local_path": "materialized_sources/corpus/methodology-ontology-design-patterns--b759ea2c/document.md", "ordinal": 9, "selector": "web://23541a33ead34e41#B9", "text_preview": "The portal was started under the NeOn project ."}
{"kind": "heading", "local_path": "materialized_sources/corpus/methodology-ontology-design-patterns--b759ea2c/document.md", "ordinal": 10, "selector": "web://23541a33ead34e41#B10", "text_preview": "What's new"}
{"kind": "paragraph", "local_path": "materialized_sources/corpus/methodology-ontology-design-patterns--b759ea2c/document.md", "ordinal": 11, "selector": "web://23541a33ead34e41#B11", "text_preview": "The 11th Workshop on Ontology Design and Patterns ( WOP2020 ) will be held at ISWC2020 (November 2) in Athens, Greece."}
{"kind": "paragraph", "local_path": "materialized_sources/corpus/methodology-ontology-design-patterns--b759ea2c/document.md", "ordinal": 12, "selector": "web://23541a33ead34e41#B12", "text_preview": "The 10th Workshop on Ontology Design and Patterns ( WOP2019 ) was held at ISWC2019 (October 27) in Auckland, New Zealand."}
{"kind": "paragraph", "local_path": "materialized_sources/corpus/methodology-ontology-design-patterns--b759ea2c/document.md", "ordinal": 13, "selector": "web://23541a33ead34e41#B13", "text_preview": "The 9th Workshop on Ontology Design and Patterns ( WOP2018 ) was held at ISWC2018 (October 9) in Monterey, CA, USA."}
{"kind": "paragraph", "local_path": "materialized_sources/corpus/methodology-ontology-design-patterns--b759ea2c/document.md", "ordinal": 14, "selector": "web://23541a33ead34e41#B14", "text_preview": "The tutorial Methods and Tools for Modular Ontology Modeling was held at ISWC2018 (October 8) in Monterey, CA, USA."}
{"kind": "paragraph", "local_path": "materialized_sources/corpus/methodology-ontology-design-patterns--b759ea2c/document.md", "ordinal": 15, "selector": "web://23541a33ead34e41#B15", "text_preview": "The 8th Workshop on Ontology Design and Patterns ( WOP2017 ) was held at ISWC2017 (October 21) in Vienna, Austria."}
{"kind": "paragraph", "local_path": "materialized_sources/corpus/methodology-ontology-design-patterns--b759ea2c/document.md", "ordinal": 16, "selector": "web://23541a33ead34e41#B16", "text_preview": "The tutorial Modular Ontology Modeling with Ontology Design Patterns was held at ESWC 2017 (May 28) in Portoroz, Slovenia."}
{"kind": "paragraph", "local_path": "materialized_sources/corpus/methodology-ontology-design-patterns--b759ea2c/document.md", "ordinal": 17, "selector": "web://23541a33ead34e41#B17", "text_preview": "The 7th Workshop on Ontology and Semantic Web Patterns ( WOP2016 ) was held at ISWC2016 (October 18) in Kobe, Japan."}
{"kind": "paragraph", "local_path": "materialized_sources/corpus/methodology-ontology-design-patterns--b759ea2c/document.md", "ordinal": 18, "selector": "web://23541a33ead34e41#B18", "text_preview": "The tutorial Ontology Design Patterns for Linked Data Publishing was held at ISWC2016 (October 17) in Kobe, Japan."}
{"kind": "paragraph", "local_path": "materialized_sources/corpus/methodology-ontology-design-patterns--b759ea2c/document.md", "ordinal": 19, "selector": "web://23541a33ead34e41#B19", "text_preview": "The Ontology Design and Patterns Association was formed - for information see the ODPA page"}
{"kind": "paragraph", "local_path": "materialized_sources/corpus/methodology-ontology-design-patterns--b759ea2c/document.md", "ordinal": 20, "selector": "web://23541a33ead34e41#B20", "text_preview": "There is much more... \nCheck out the about ODP page for more information on the portal content and structure."}
